{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Introduction</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The intended playtime is approximately 20-30 minutes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While there are minimal puzzle elements, they are primarily part of the game's narrative devices and atmospheric effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is primarily designed to be an experience-driven narrative game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Overview</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This title is a psychological suspense/puzzle adventure game where a player-controlled protagonist, suffering from memory loss, navigates a computer file management system to uncover fragments of their past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players will explore files and folders while gradually uncovering the hidden truth through the unfolding story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Game Streaming Guidelines</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel free to stream the game! Though we'd be grateful if you could promote the store link during your stream.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4074590?t=1762585212","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4074590/4a36097ca23ef8442584198efe08890bdddf3c0e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762585212","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4074590/5758bb3802db07e13c507f93c00d49590585f1a8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762585212","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4074590/5758bb3802db07e13c507f93c00d49590585f1a8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762585212","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"descripti